shots 1
# Two bots meet by the lake at sunset and fly off together into it. The man walks south from the lane's end
# (sunset-him.script), the woman north from the car park (sunset-her.script, the companion); they stop face to
# face at about (68, -34) on the strip between the lake's kerb and the car park, turn west to the sun, take off
# and fly over the water side by side. Cameras stay west of x 71, clear of the car park's first row.
# Seconds of the run, metres, degrees; y is up.
# from behind her, down the strip, a long lens: the two walking toward each other
0     fixed at=66.5,1.5,-66 look=68,1.3,-34 fov=26
# beside them, the sun ahead: two figures against the evening
6.6   fixed at=70.6,1.6,-35.5 look=40,2.4,-22 fov=52  cut
# closer, from behind her shoulder, as they stand looking at it
10    fixed at=70.4,1.45,-38.5 look=60,1.7,-28 fov=44  blend 1.5
# take-off, from low, watching him rise
12.3  fixed at=70.8,0.6,-36.5 fov=62  blend 0.8
# following them over the water toward the sun
14.8  beside offset=3,2,-9 fov=46  blend 1.5
# round them as they hang in the last of the light
18.6  orbit distance=8 height=1 speed=15  blend 1.5
